.SUBCKT FEMT 1 2 PARAMS: NLFF=25e3 FLWF=260 NVRF=3530
**************************
* BEGIN SETUP OF NOISE GEN - FEMPTOAMPS/RT-HZ
* INPUT THREE VARIABLES
