* QSE RF transformer: coupled-inductor starting model, not a physical part model.
* Symbol pin order: right top, right bottom, left top, left bottom.
* Left winding is primary; N is secondary/primary turns ratio.
* Default: 1:1, 1uH primary, coupling 0.999. No winding loss or capacitance.
.SUBCKT TRAFO_RF_QSE S1 S2 P1 P2 PARAMS: LP=1u N=1 KC=0.999
LPRI P1 P2 {LP}
LSEC S1 S2 {LP*N*N}
KTRAFO LPRI LSEC {KC}
.ENDS TRAFO_RF_QSE

