* the .model line after user-run warnings. NPN is already the model type.
* Vcbo=50 remains in the parameter list as a rating, with no model effect.
* All other manufacturer parameter values and equations are unchanged.
* The ZIP's bc337-25.asy SpiceLine repeats the same 15 parameter defaults
* declared in this subcircuit. All are included here; no symbol file is needed
* to supply simulation parameters, and no external model file is required.
* Symbol Type X; subcircuit name BC337-25; terminal order: C, B, E.
* The default hfe=400 is the manufacturer's model value, not a guaranteed
* gain for every BC337-25 device. This is a simplified parameter-based model.
